#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:5
#: 559da0a758264741b232d4e904479794
msgid "Mission Planner Advanced Installation"
msgstr "Mission Planner 高级安装"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:7
#: b3f71dba48964ca18622b5a79e9a0bb4
msgid ""
"This article explains how you can change where Mission Planner is installed,"
" and how to install older versions if needed (not recommended)."
msgstr "本文介绍如何更改 Mission Planner 的安装位置，以及如何安装旧版本（不推荐）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:12
#: d361a9ab14dd4a82a1c71c283d64b240
msgid "Installing Mission Planner In a Different Location"
msgstr "在其他位置安装 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:14
#: 8947946b9d534013bf6a08941dfb67ad
msgid ""
"Sometimes you may want to keep  or install the current or different version "
"of Mission Planner in a folder different from the normal location used by "
"the :ref:`MSI installation <install-mission-planner>`. You can do this by "
"downloading the \"zip\" version which contains all the files necessary and "
"placing the files into a folder of your choice."
msgstr ""
"有时您可能希望将当前或其他版本的 Mission Planner 安装到与 :ref:`MSI 安装 <install-mission-"
"planner>` 默认路径不同的文件夹中。您可以通过下载包含所有必要文件的「zip」版本，并将文件放置到您选择的文件夹中来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:21
#: ed09e59fb7c940349e7492edaeaa2b27
msgid "Download the most recent Mission Planner ZIP Files"
msgstr "下载最新的 Mission Planner ZIP 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:23
#: 2cdd0dc31efe4b97a0aaa0b4634ed14c
msgid ""
"You can find all the different versions of Mission Planner zip (and MSI) "
"files `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/>`__. The "
"most recent version of the zip file can be `downloaded from here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.zip>`__."
msgstr ""
"您可以在 `这里 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/>`__ 找到所有不同版本的"
" Mission Planner zip（及 MSI）文件。最新版本的 zip 文件可 `从这里下载 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MissionPlanner/MissionPlanner-"
"latest.zip>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:27
#: 1cdfa45d9ed143aa9abed6a4a542fd26
msgid "Download and save the zip file to your computer."
msgstr "下载 zip 文件并保存到您的计算机。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:30
#: 7c36d901e0624d86910881f3ef593a42
msgid "Install (Un-zip) the files to the desired folder"
msgstr "安装（解压）文件到目标文件夹"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:32
#: 1a3317cefd6e42d9b8e589225af45c8c
msgid "Here is how you \"install\" a version into a different folder:"
msgstr "以下是如何将某个版本「安装」到其他文件夹的步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:34
#: d98dfa0f26414f338f4e1c5a6a32b87d
msgid ""
"Unzip the downloaded zip files into the folder where you want them "
"installed. (see your winzip manual)"
msgstr "将下载的 zip 文件解压到您希望安装的文件夹中（请参阅 WinZip 使用手册）。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:37
#: 9f53f386665542de87b85c57757b8584
msgid ""
"We suggest un-zipping to Program Files folder where the normal installation "
"is, but with a different folder name I.E. a folder name like Mission "
"Planner-xxx where xxx is the version number."
msgstr ""
"建议解压到 Program Files 文件夹中（与正常安装位置相同），但使用不同的文件夹名称，例如 Mission Planner-xxx，其中 "
"xxx 为版本号。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:40
#: cc3aee8c62be47f6b1b81d914e43864a
msgid ""
"After you do the un-zip, you should have all the files necessary to run that"
" version of MP in the new folder."
msgstr "解压完成后，您应该在新文件夹中拥有运行该版本 MP 所需的所有文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:43
#: 7f9e9aeceae7423ab5e84329a3b466d2
msgid ""
"You can run this version by double clicking on the MissionPlanner.exe file "
"in the folder's root."
msgstr "您可以通过双击该文件夹根目录中的 MissionPlanner.exe 文件来运行此版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:45
#: 589c05665b134ff199ee7f66cc750d83
msgid ""
"Be sure to answer \"no\" to the upgrade notice if you want to stay with the "
"version you are using in that folder."
msgstr "如果您希望保持使用当前文件夹中的版本，请确保在弹出升级提示时选择「否」。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:47
#: f45cf14bed4b41768b6c72782b52a109
msgid "To create a desktop icon for that version do this:"
msgstr "如需为该版本创建桌面快捷方式，请执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:49
#: 86e1ea452ad94864bfd803608a8e1abf
msgid "Find the file MissionPlanner.exe in the folder's root."
msgstr "在文件夹根目录中找到 MissionPlanner.exe 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:50
#: 09bd655632814a0bbf0da46e32ab3a8d
msgid "Right click and hold the file name and drag it to your desktop"
msgstr "右键单击并按住文件名，将其拖拽到桌面。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:51
#: 7555d97728384b5ebcab94e1ff5ffc51
msgid ""
"Select the 'Create a shortcut here\" option when you release the mouse "
"button."
msgstr "释放鼠标按钮时，选择「Create a shortcut here」选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:53
#: 9de970288e8d4889acf0cea88ff9a6a2
msgid "Right click on the new icon and select Rename."
msgstr "右键单击新图标并选择「重命名」。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:54
#: 75f87e2126154f93a7792472649e15b7
msgid ""
"Change the name to include the version number or some text to identify the "
"icon to start this version of MP"
msgstr "修改名称，加入版本号或其他说明文字，以便识别该图标对应的 MP 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:58
#: 67ee06c23cf946ebb93f0b08ee6fa555
msgid "Using older version of Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用旧版 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:60
#: 87fc2d673b7c4dc99aef08e7c64bbd98
msgid ""
"Using older versions of Mission Planner is discouraged because the latest "
"version should work with most platforms and will have fewer bugs."
msgstr "不建议使用旧版 Mission Planner，因为最新版本通常支持大多数平台并修复了更多问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:63
#: 2794b1e63c49428bb3fffe486f411cfb
msgid ""
"However if you are using an older APM with an older version of firmware that"
" is working well for you it may make sense not to update the firmware. "
"Alternatively you might have more than one platform (for instance a plane "
"and a quad copter or two planes) and you want to keep a different version of"
" the Mission Planner for each on your ground station.  This keeps the "
"configuration files, the log files and saved parameter files separate - "
"making life much easier."
msgstr ""
"但如果您使用的是旧款 APM "
"且搭配运行良好的旧版固件，可能没有必要更新固件。此外，若您拥有多个平台（例如一架固定翼和一架四轴飞行器，或两架固定翼），并希望在地面站上为每个平台保留不同版本的"
" Mission Planner，这样可以将配置文件、日志文件和已保存的参数文件分开管理，使操作更加便捷。"

#: ../../source/docs/mission-planner-advanced-installation.rst:73
#: 9b529cfde71044c487deb33a7b1d6dd0
msgid ""
"Use older versions of Mission Planner at your own risk.  Do not attempt to "
"upgrade firmware with older versions. Each new platform firmware update "
"usually requires the latest Mission Planner version."
msgstr ""
"使用旧版 Mission Planner 风险自担。请勿尝试使用旧版本升级固件。每次新平台固件更新通常需要最新版本的 Mission Planner。"
